   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWF 2013 South - WWF Frame 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WWF 2013 Syd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rambidrag till WWF f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till civilsamh&#xe4;lleorganisationer och barn och unga i syd inom de tv&#xe5; programmen Sustaining Life och Education   for Sustainable Development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution entails two programs. 1. Sustaining Life with three  subcomponents: Strengthened civil society, Improved livelihoods and   More sustainable management of natural resources. 2. Education for    Sustainable Development with three subcomponents: Strengthened youth  voice, Improved youth entrepreneurship and ESD is more widely spread  in school system.</narrative>
  </description>
